# Open Directory (Ctrl+O): the path picker lists subdirectories, Tab and / drill, Backspace goes back, Enter switches.
file alpha/inner/a.txt
a
end
file apple/b.txt
b
end
file beta/c.txt
c
end
file notes.txt
root notes
end
run notes.txt
wait root notes
key ctrl+o
wait apple
snap open
type a
snap filtered
key tab
snap drilled
key backspace
snap back
type be
key tab
key enter
snap switched
